            "ans": "Answer:\na) Classification by Atomicity:\n• Monoatomic molecules: He, Ar\n• Diatomic molecules: N2, HCl\n• Triatomic molecules: H2O, CO2\n• Polyatomic molecules: S8 (octa-atomic), H2SO4 (hepta-atomic), C6H12O6 (24 atoms)\n\nb) Classification of Chemical Species:\n• Cations (positive monoatomic ions): Na+, Mg2+\n• Anions (negative monoatomic ions): Cl-, O2-\n• Molecular Ions (polyatomic ions/charged radicals): CH4+ (cationic), CO+ (cationic), CO3^2- (anionic), C2H5O- (anionic)\n• Free Radicals (unpaired odd electron): Cl•\n• Neutral Molecules: C6H12O6, CO2, H2O"
